flowchart TB
    User[User: conversation and project controls] --> Console[Gideon native console / CLI / desktop]
    Console --> Runtime[Gideon runtime: turn ownership and approvals]
    Runtime --> Journal[Authoritative append-only journal]
    Runtime --> Adapter[Hypermid Python host adapter]
    Adapter --> Daemon[Authenticated local module supervisor]
    Daemon --> Projection[Deterministic context projection]
    Daemon --> Knowledge[Knowledge and retrieval]
    Daemon --> Background[Budgeted history and maintenance jobs]
    Daemon --> Modules[Scoped tool / model / transform modules]
    Journal --> Projection
    Journal --> Background
    Background --> Knowledge
    Background --> Projection
    Knowledge --> Projection
    Projection --> Provider[Gideon provider request]
    Provider --> Runtime
    Runtime --> Delivery[Gideon authoritative final delivery]
    Delivery --> Console
    Projection --> Store[Owned storage, fenced leases and durable intents]
    Knowledge --> Store
    Modules --> Store
    Daemon --> Events[Durable events, cursors and diagnostics]
    Events --> Console
